  "description": "The RUUT AL2 is a great entry-level all-rounder. Whether you're hitting the trails for winter training, commuting to work, or venturing into the world of gravel biking for the first time, this bike has you covered. Sporting bridgeless seat stays and a striking Rosewood aluminum frame, the RUUT AL2 is as durable as it is stylish.What makes the RUUT exceptionally versatile is the unique TwinTip fork – a feature that allows you to fine-tune the handling and set up your bike exactly the way you like – relaxed or racy, the choice is yours to make at any point in time.Engineered for reliability, it features top-notch SHIMANO GRX hydraulic brakes, V2 carbon fork, and a dependable 2x10 drivetrain with SHIMANO RX400 derailleurs. With its mud-proof WTB Riddler tires and responsive handling, this bike is ready to tackle any terrain. Plus, its elegant internal cable routing adds a touch of sophistication to its clean finish.Get ready to embark on countless adventures with the RUUT AL2 ROSEWOOD by your side.",
